<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 11. [CORRECTED 16:49 GMT]</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 11. [CORRECTED 16:49 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Wednesday, June 11:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,667.70 (1,664.70)	CHF  1,156.50 (1,158.40)</p>
<p>    DEM    973.90 (971.18)	  GBP  2,731.70 (2,722.60)</p>
<p>    ATS    138.39 (corrects figure from 138.90) (138.00)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Tuesday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $28.34 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$22.18 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $50.52 million ($48.56 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
